Description: Converts large Danish register SAS files (`.sas7bdat`) into
    Parquet format with automatic year-based Hive partitioning and
    chunked reading for larger-than-memory files. Supports batch and
    parallel conversion with a targets pipeline and reading those
    registers into DuckDB tables for faster querying and analyses.
